## What changed

| Location | Before | Now |
|---|---|---|
| Docstring | `YOUR NAME HERE` | `Gesner Deslandes — Software Engineer` |
| Config block | `YOUR_NAME = "YOUR NAME HERE"` | `YOUR_NAME = "GESNER DESLANDES"` |
| Config block | — | added `YOUR_TITLE`, `YOUR_PHONE`, `YOUR_EMAIL` |
| Page header | name + "Nest — My HTML App Hub" | name, title, phone, email, app name |
| Page footer | — | new footer with your contact info |
| Browser tab | `Nest · YOUR NAME HERE` | `NEST — MY HTML HUB · GESNER DESLANDES` |
| README | placeholder | full contact block + license |

The header on the live page will look like this:

> **GESNER DESLANDES**
> SOFTWARE ENGINEER
> 📞 (509)-47385663 · ✉️ deslandes78@gmail.com
> **NEST — MY HTML HUB**

And the same info repeats at the bottom of the page as a footer.

Once you paste these two files into your repo and push, Streamlit Cloud will redeploy automatically and show everything with your name on it.
